</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c3e97ff2-89f9-11f1-9e09-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/ROYAUME-UNI-UKRAINE-ANDY-BURNHAM-VOLODYMYR-ZELENSKY.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c3e97ff2-89f9-11f1-9e09-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/ROYAUME-UNI-UKRAINE-ANDY-BURNHAM-VOLODYMYR-ZELENSKY.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">fe54218e-89fd-11f1-bca9-55a3ef88b1dc</guid><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 20:59:12 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c3e97ff2-89f9-11f1-9e09-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/ROYAUME-UNI-UKRAINE-ANDY-BURNHAM-VOLODYMYR-ZELENSKY.jpg">Simon Jones/Pool The Sun via AP - Simon Jones</source><dc:creator>法广</dc:creator></item><item><category>中东</category><title>特朗普辟谣说：“有很多弹药”</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%9C/20260727-%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E8%BE%9F%E8%B0%A3%E8%AF%B4-%E6%9C%89%E5%BE%88%E5%A4%9A%E5%BC%B9%E8%8D%AF</link><description>
